#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
chronotype.py — Temporal identity fingerprinting.

tok/s IS the speed of AI. Latency IS the heartbeat.
We can use timing to back-trace the full identity:

  AI identity:    tok/s, latency, output length, think time
  Human identity: typing cadence, pause patterns, session rhythm

A FOREMAN is wordy — fast, action-oriented, lots of text.
A SCIENTIST thinks and plans — long pauses, then precise input.
A CODER bursts — rapid fire, then silence, then rapid fire.
A PHILOSOPHER meanders — slow, contemplative, circular.

These chronotypes map to the BingoCube epitope shapes
WITHOUT requiring passwords, accounts, or login.
The TIMING is the identity. ZK.

Usage:
  python chronotype.py --arena     # show AI chronotypes from arena battles
  python chronotype.py --humans    # show human chronotype framework
"""

